Vendored OpenSCAD libraries
---------------------------
Seven upstream OpenSCAD libraries are vendored unmodified under
`openscad/vendor/<name>-<revision>/`. Every tree keeps its upstream `LICENSE`
and a `REVISION` file naming the pinned commit, the license, the copyright
holder and the vendored file list, and the same revisions are registered in the
`libraries` map of `openscad/catalog.json`, so the shipped catalog and the
vendored sources cannot drift apart unnoticed. The same backend and source
trees are embedded in the single-file `orcad.py` release.

The vendored sources remain under their own licenses and are not relicensed by
this repository. The catalog, wrappers, runner, bridge adapter, and other
integration code remain under this repository's AGPL-3.0-only terms. Any
additional upstream attribution requirements MUST be verified against the
authoritative vendored license and README. Full details are in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

